window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-962f1c5913098b93"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"build-an-interactive-lesson-resource\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">制作互动式课程资源</h1> <p>把已批准的课程材料包转化为经过测试的学生学习体验。</p> <p>使用 Sites，根据已批准的教学材料、练习题、反馈规则、无障碍要求和设计偏好，制作并测试互动式课程资源，供教师审核。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>希望把已审核材料转化为互动练习的教师。</li> <li>需要引导示例、反馈和最终自查的课程。</li> <li>需要进行无障碍测试并由教师批准的学生用资源。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>sites</code></td> <td>制作、预览、测试并发布互动式课程资源。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>收集已批准的课程材料包和配套材料。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>制作互动式课程资源</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请使用 @sites，根据此文件夹中已批准的课程材料包，为 [grade, subject, and topic] 制作一项互动式课程资源。\n\n请包括：\n- 简短介绍\n- 一个引导示例\n- 三项带反馈的互动练习\n- 一项最终自查\n- 教师备注\n\n请满足我提供的无障碍要求和反馈规则。测试主要操作路径并报告限制；在我批准审核后的版本之前，不要发布或分享该资源。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites 文档</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/showcase/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites 展示案例（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"start-from-approved-instructional-content\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">从已批准的教学内容开始</h2> <p>使用经过审核的课程材料包、练习题、反馈规则、无障碍要求和设计偏好。明确学习目标，以及证明学生完成了预期练习的依据。</p> <p>不要编造缺失的教学政策或学习者信息。</p> <p><a id=\"build-the-learning-flow\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">设计学习流程</h2> <p>一个范围适当的首版应包括：</p> <ul> <li>清楚的介绍</li> <li>一个引导示例</li> <li>少量互动练习</li> <li>符合所提供规则的反馈</li> <li>一项最终自查</li> <li>面向教师的备注</li> </ul> <p>使用 Sites 制作并预览资源。保持交互模式简单，以便充分测试。</p> <p><a id=\"test-before-sharing\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_8\">分享前进行测试</h2> <p>检查主要操作路径、键盘使用、控件标签、颜色对比度、响应式行为、反馈逻辑和内容准确性。正确答案和错误答案都要测试。</p> <p>请 ChatGPT 记录限制，以及尚未解决的无障碍或教学问题。资源发布或分享给学生之前，应由教师批准。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"build-an-interactive-lesson-resource\">Build an interactive lesson resource</h1> <p>Turn an approved lesson package into a tested student experience.</p> <p>Use Sites with approved lesson materials, practice questions, feedback rules, accessibility requirements, and design preferences to build and test an interactive lesson resource for educator review.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Teachers turning reviewed materials into interactive practice.</li> <li>Lessons that need guided examples, feedback, and a final self-check.</li> <li>Student-facing resources that require accessibility testing and educator approval.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>sites</code></td> <td>Build, preview, test, and publish an interactive lesson resource.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>google-drive</code></td> <td>Gather the approved lesson package and supporting materials.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Build an Interactive Lesson Resource</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use @sites to build an interactive lesson resource for [grade, subject, and topic] from the approved lesson package in this folder.\n\nInclude:\n- a short introduction\n- one guided example\n- three practice interactions with feedback\n- a final self-check\n- teacher notes\n\nMeet the accessibility requirements and feedback rules I provide. Test the main paths, report limitations, and do not publish or share the resource until I approve the reviewed version.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-3c6726ad641677d6\">Sites documentation</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/showcase/sites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sites showcase (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"start-from-approved-instructional-content\">Start from approved instructional content</h2> <p>Use the reviewed lesson package, practice questions, feedback rules, accessibility requirements, and design preferences. Identify the learning goal and the evidence that a student has completed the intended practice.</p> <p>Do not invent missing instructional policy or learner data.</p> <h2 id=\"build-the-learning-flow\">Build the learning flow</h2> <p>A focused first version should include:</p> <ul> <li>a clear introduction</li> <li>a guided example</li> <li>a small set of practice interactions</li> <li>feedback that follows the supplied rules</li> <li>a final self-check</li> <li>teacher-facing notes</li> </ul> <p>Use Sites to build and preview the resource. Keep the interaction model simple enough to test thoroughly.</p> <h2 id=\"test-before-sharing\">Test before sharing</h2> <p>Check the main paths, keyboard use, labels, contrast, responsive behavior, feedback logic, and content accuracy. Test incorrect as well as correct responses.</p> <p>Ask ChatGPT to document limitations and unresolved accessibility or instructional questions. An educator should approve the reviewed resource before it is published or shared with students.</p>"};
